 I'd be happy to help you set up Single Sign-On (SSO) using Auth0 for multiple React applications. Here's a step-by-step guide with an emphasis on both helpfulness and verbosity:

1. **Create an Auth0 Account**: If you don't already have one, sign up for an Auth0 account at https://auth0.com.

